      "id": "claim_5daf1a1cd8c440088e8ddf9a01cf8059",
      "statement": "Brijio's runtime is a single explicit request/response chain Agent -> MCP Server -> WebSocket Relay -> Browser Extension -> Browser Session; the browser remains the source of truth, with no cloned browser, continuous page stream, or background surveillance, and every browser read or action is initiated by an explicit MCP request.",
